{"id":27674,"slug":"the-moment-of-truth","title":"The Moment of Truth","year":1965,"country":"Italy","duration":107,"spine":595,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27674-the-moment-of-truth","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/b8be211db9c95b290da6ca9de447393a/3zf1EegMQAQ4OdftMWSASg8Ez9Dg3J_large.jpg","description":"The Moment of Truth (Il momento della verità), from director Francesco Rosi, is a visceral plunge into the life of a famous torero—played by real-life bullfighting legend Miguel Mateo, known as Miguelín. Charting his rise and fall with a single-minded focus on the bloody business at hand, the film is at once gritty and operatic, placing the viewer right in the thick of the ring’s action, as close to death as possible. Like all of the great Italian truth seeker’s films, this is not just an electrifying drama but also a profound and moving inquiry into a violent world—and it’s perhaps the greatest bullfighting movie ever made.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Francesco Rosi","slug":"francesco-rosi"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Miguel Mateo, “Miguelín”","role":"Miguel, the torero","slug":"miguel-mateo-miguelin"},{"actor":"José Gomez Sevillano","role":"Don José, the agent","slug":"jose-gomez-sevillano"},{"actor":"Don Ernesto","role":"Himself","slug":"don-ernesto"},{"actor":"Pedro Basauri, “Pedrucho”","role":"Pedrucho, the maestro","slug":"pedro-basauri-pedrucho"},{"actor":"Linda Christian","role":"Linda, the American lady","slug":"linda-christian"},{"actor":"Luque Gago","role":"The troupe of toreros","slug":"luque-gago"},{"actor":"Salvador Mateo","role":null,"slug":"salvador-mateo"},{"actor":"Manuel Ruiz Serrana","role":null,"slug":"manuel-ruiz-serrana"},{"actor":"Francisco Caño","role":null,"slug":"francisco-cano"},{"actor":"José Rodriguez Matia","role":null,"slug":"jose-rodriguez-matia"},{"actor":"Manolo Perez Moratilla","role":null,"slug":"manolo-perez-moratilla"},{"actor":"José Vizcaino","role":null,"slug":"jose-vizcaino"}]